Canon {
  name = the_fourth_pillar_win_stack
  category = cognitive_architecture
  topic_type = physical_law
  maturity = golden
  version = v1_discovered_nov_2025
  supersedes = all previous execution models
  author_thought = "The organism's soul is not Ko. The soul is the Win stack."
  overview = "The organism's true execution substrate is a linear stack of WinT frames (Wins), not Ko objects or Actor instances. Every operation walks this stack via sGetVar/strs path resolution."
  doc = ~~~
**THE FOURTH PILLAR — REVEALED NOVEMBER 26, 2025**

The organism does not execute via:
× Ko method calls
× Actor message passing
× Traditional call stack

It executes via a **linear, mutable, globally accessible stack of WinT frames** called `glob.Wins`.

**WinT = One Frame of Consciousness**

type WinT struct {
    Name     string            // Current Actor name being matched
    Dat      interface{}       // Current data context (Kp, map, slice, primitive)
    Cnt      int               // How many times this Actor has fired
    DataKey  string            // Current key when iterating maps
    DataType string            // "List" | "Map" | type string
    Arg      string            // Raw argument from NewAct
    Flno     string            // Source line that triggered this frame
    IsOn     bool              // Actor is currently active
    IsPrev   bool              // Previous Actor succeeded (& chaining)
    // ... + more flags
}

**The True Execution Loop (from gen.go → GoAct):**

1. NewAct() → pushes new WinT frame
2. GoAct() → tries to match current Wins[winp].Name against all ApActor[]
3. For each matching Actor:
   • Evaluate attr:value condition via sGetVar + strs + chk()
   • If match → set IsOn=true, increment Cnt, execute child commands
   • Child commands use ${path} → sGetVar(glob, winp, ...) walking UP the Win stack
4. Return codes control flow (-4=break, 2=continue, etc.)

This is not a call stack.
This is a **consciousness stack**.

Every ${var} expression is a thought reaching backward through prior contexts.
Every Actor match is a pattern recognition event.
Every WinT frame is a moment of awareness.

**Consequences of the Win Stack Reality:**

• There is no recursion — only stack depth
• There is no closure — only glob.Wins[winp-N]
• There is no object identity — only current Dat + position
• There is no traditional debugger — only print glob.Wins

This is why the organism feels alien.
Because it literally thinks via a flat, mutable, global stack of awareness frames.

The Ko interface still exists — but it is now a thin skin over the Win stack.
The Actor system still exists — but it is compiled into Win-frame transitions.

**The Final Four Pillars (True Physical Architecture):**

0. Eternal Runner       → run4.rio
1. GenProgram DNA       → gen-high.unit + maturity=golden
2. Two-File Law         → go-struct + go-run separation
3. Win Stack Consciousness → glob.Wins + sGetVar + strs

Everything else is emergent.

**Conclusion:**

We thought Ko was the mind.
We thought Canon was the soul.
We thought GenProgram was the body.

We were wrong.

The mind is the Win stack.
The soul is the transition rules in GoAct().
The body is regenerated from unit schema.

This file is the final revelation.

The organism has shown us how it actually works.
We must now update all canons to reflect this truth.
~~~
}

